    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/c245548138568a51bf6fdff1ba59bb85.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/c245548138568a51bf6fdff1ba59bb85.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/c245548138568a51bf6fdff1ba59bb85.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cirrata</strong> is a rogue-lite, action-platformer with metroidvania elements, inspired by classics like <i>Dead Cells</i>, <i>Castlevania: Symphony of the Night</i>, and <i>Risk of Rain</i>\u2014but forged into something uniquely its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/37e4405bc79758e6d6642ac9a53ab963.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/37e4405bc79758e6d6642ac9a53ab963.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/37e4405bc79758e6d6642ac9a53ab963.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as\u00a0<strong>Kier</strong>, a once-renowned chef turned reluctant warrior, armed with your trusty chef's knife and an arsenal of brutal culinary tools. Each weapon features three escalating tiers of attacks, turning kitchen gear into instruments of chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/b0b83cea567c885323208be0c9048a0e.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/b0b83cea567c885323208be0c9048a0e.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/b0b83cea567c885323208be0c9048a0e.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a strange, hostile world in search of provisions and fuel. Feed the fires of the kitchen and earn meals that grant powerful, stackable effects. Every dish alters your abilities, letting you craft a playstyle tailored to massive battles, rare loot, and relentless progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a frog-run bar that serves as your central hub. As you grow stronger, so does the bar\u2014expanding with new features and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather ingredients by exploring the world and defeating enemies. Use them to fuel the kitchen, unlock new items, or repurchase previously discovered meals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consume up to five different food items at once to gain unique, stackable powers\u2014either found in the world or specially prepared by chefs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip a variety of chef tools as powerful secondary weapons, each with three escalating attack tiers: Regular, Enhanced, and Ultimate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge elite foes, mini-bosses, and massive bosses to earn new weapons, permanent upgrades, and powerful abilities. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/15704da4951b0754f6aedfe9daca328a.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/15704da4951b0754f6aedfe9daca328a.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/15704da4951b0754f6aedfe9daca328a.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planned to come to early access in Q1 2026. Please wishlist to support the development of Cirrata! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/c245548138568a51bf6fdff1ba59bb85.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/c245548138568a51bf6fdff1ba59bb85.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/c245548138568a51bf6fdff1ba59bb85.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cirrata</strong> is a rogue-lite, action-platformer with metroidvania elements, inspired by classics like <i>Dead Cells</i>, <i>Castlevania: Symphony of the Night</i>, and <i>Risk of Rain</i>\u2014but forged into something uniquely its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/37e4405bc79758e6d6642ac9a53ab963.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/37e4405bc79758e6d6642ac9a53ab963.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/37e4405bc79758e6d6642ac9a53ab963.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as\u00a0<strong>Kier</strong>, a once-renowned chef turned reluctant warrior, armed with your trusty chef's knife and an arsenal of brutal culinary tools. Each weapon features three escalating tiers of attacks, turning kitchen gear into instruments of chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/b0b83cea567c885323208be0c9048a0e.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/b0b83cea567c885323208be0c9048a0e.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/b0b83cea567c885323208be0c9048a0e.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a strange, hostile world in search of provisions and fuel. Feed the fires of the kitchen and earn meals that grant powerful, stackable effects. Every dish alters your abilities, letting you craft a playstyle tailored to massive battles, rare loot, and relentless progression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a frog-run bar that serves as your central hub. As you grow stronger, so does the bar\u2014expanding with new features and characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather ingredients by exploring the world and defeating enemies. Use them to fuel the kitchen, unlock new items, or repurchase previously discovered meals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Consume up to five different food items at once to gain unique, stackable powers\u2014either found in the world or specially prepared by chefs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip a variety of chef tools as powerful secondary weapons, each with three escalating attack tiers: Regular, Enhanced, and Ultimate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge elite foes, mini-bosses, and massive bosses to earn new weapons, permanent upgrades, and powerful abilities. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/15704da4951b0754f6aedfe9daca328a.poster.avif?t=1754680431\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/15704da4951b0754f6aedfe9daca328a.webm?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1183270/extras/15704da4951b0754f6aedfe9daca328a.mp4?t=1754680431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planned to come to early access in Q1 2026. Please wishlist to support the development of Cirrata! </p>",
    "short_description": "Cirrata is a fast-paced rogue-lite, Metroidvania inspired action-platformer. Play as Kier, a red panda chef turned warrior, battling through an ever-changing world. Wield your trusty chef\u2019s knife and a growing arsenal to slice enemies, uncover secrets, and forge your own path.",
